  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Therefore,&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />We take <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3,0</mn></math> because when <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LHS</mi></math>&nbsp;of the given equation will be negative whereas <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is positive.<br />Hence, the number of values <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
  }
